    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d384">

                <pb facs="0439" n="1173" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1173"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Taylor.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Arrangements now complete for tender in Washington, 15th instant, of negotiable
                    drafts payable London, English gold equivalent of Spanish gold. If not already
                    done, answer note of minister for foreign affairs in response to yours of 18th
                    June last, as directed in my telegram of August 24.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
